{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2021-12-10 08:00:00', 'title': 'MEDTRONIC ANNOUNCES CASH DIVIDEND FOR THIRD QUARTER OF FISCAL YEAR 2022', 'text': 'DUBLIN, DEC. 10, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF MEDTRONIC PLC (NYSE:MDT) ON THURSDAY, DECEMBER 9, 2021, APPROVED THE FISCAL YEAR 2022 THIRD QUARTER CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.63 PER ORDINARY SHARE, REPRESENTING A 9 PERCENT INCREASE OVER THE PRIOR YEAR. THIS QUARTERLY DECLARATION IS CONSISTENT WITH THE DIVIDEND ANNOUNCEMENT MADE BY THE COMPANY IN MAY 2021.'}